※ pl4g-test: module
※※ What the module handed on holds: a type, something inside it, a function and
※※ an enumeration -- one of each thing a path can name.

@[export]
type Box = n : u8

@[export]
fn Box.get(b: Box) → u8:
    b.n

@[export]
fn twice(n: u8) → u8:
    n + n

@[export]
enum Colour:
    red ;
    green
